  "prompt": "You are an expert JavaScript developer. Create a single-page, standalone HTML document containing a fully playable \"Tango\" logic puzzle game.\n\nSTRICT TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n1. ALL HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be contained within a single file. No external libraries.\n2. Do NOT output markdown code blocks (```html). Start exactly with <!DOCTYPE html> and end with </html>.\n\nTHEME & VISUALS:\n1. The game must look polished and modern, utilizing a clean, balanced interface.\n2. The grid must be 6x6 cells.\n3. The two playing symbols MUST be the Fire emoji (\ud83d\udd25) and the Ice Cube emoji (\ud83e\uddca).\n4. Constraint markers must clearly sit on the borders between adjacent cells using an Equals sign (=) or a Cross (\u00d7).\n\nCORE GAMEPLAY RULES:\n1. Row and Column Balance: Every row and every column must contain exactly three \ud83d\udd25 and three \ud83e\uddca.\n2. No Three in a Row: You cannot place three identical symbols adjacent to each other horizontally or vertically.\n3. Constraint Markers:\n   - '=' (Equals): The two adjacent cells must contain the same symbol.\n   - '\u00d7' (Cross): The two adjacent cells must contain opposite symbols.\n4. Interactivity: Clicking a cell should cycle its state: Empty -> \ud83d\udd25 -> \ud83e\uddca -> Empty.\n\nBACK-END LOGIC & PROCEDURAL GENERATION SPECS:\nThe game MUST generate a brand new, random, playable board on every page load. Implement the generation using this sequence:\n1. Solution Generation (Backtracking): Write a recursive backtracking function to generate a fully populated, valid 6x6 grid that obeys the Balance and No-Three-In-A-Row rules. \n2. Constraint Placement: Once a valid solved board exists, randomly select 6 to 8 pairs of adjacent cells. If the cells share the same symbol, place an '=' marker between them. If they are different, place an '\u00d7' marker.\n3. Puzzle Creation: After placing constraints, randomly clear (empty) 70% of the cells, leaving a few starting symbols and the constraint markers as hints for the player.\n4. Validation: Implement a \"Check Solution\" button that compares the user's current grid against the underlying rules (Balance, No-Three-In-A-Row, and Constraints). Highlight any errors in red.\n\nEnsure the state management clearly separates the \"solution board\" from the \"player board\", and that markers overlay the grid lines cleanly using CSS absolute positioning or a highly refined Grid layout.\n",
  "rawOutput": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tango \u2014 Logic Puzzle</title>\n<style>\n  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0f1117;--surface:#1a1d27;--surface2:#242836;--border:#2e3348;\n    --text:#e2e4f0;--text-dim:#7a7f96;--accent:#f59e0b;--accent-glow:rgba(245,158,11,.25);\n    --fire:#ef4444;--ice:#38bdf8;--error:#f87171;--success:#34d399;\n    --cell-size:min(11vw,72px);--gap:4px;\n  }\n  html,body{height:100%;font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}\n  body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;padding:16px;gap:20px}\n\n  h1{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n  h1 span{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fire),var(--ice));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}\n\n  .subtitle{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:.85rem;text-align:center;max-width:400px;line-height:1.5}\n\n  .rules-bar{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-dim)}\n  .rules-bar div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:var(--surface);padding:5px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}\n  .rules-bar .sym{font-size:1rem}\n\n  .board-wrapper{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .board{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,var(--cell-size));grid-template-rows:repeat(12,var(--cell-size));\n    gap:var(--gap);background:var(--surface);padding:var(--gap);border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--border);\n    box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n  }\n\n  .cell{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(var(--cell-size)*.55);\n    background:var(--surface2);border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;\n    transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s,border-color .15s;\n    border:2px solid transparent;position:relative;\n  }\n  .cell:hover{background:#2c3044}\n  .cell.fire{color:var(--fire);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(239,68,68,.4)}\n  .cell.ice{color:var(--ice);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(56,189,248,.4)}\n  .cell.fixed{cursor:default;opacity:.9}\n  .cell.fixed::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:6px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}\n  .cell.error{border-color:var(--error) !important;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(248,113,113,.3)}\n  .cell.correct-flash{border-color:var(--success) !important;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(52,211,153,.3)}\n\n  .constraint{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:calc(var(--cell-size)*.45);\n    font-weight:700;color:var(--text-dim);border-radius:6px;pointer-events:none;\n    background:transparent;\n  }\n  .constraint.h{color:var(--accent)}\n  .constraint.v{color:var(--accent)}\n  .constraint.empty{visibility:hidden}\n\n  .spacer{visibility:hidden}\n\n  .controls{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}\n  button{\n    padding:10px 24px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);\n    color:var(--text);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\n  }\n  button:hover{background:var(--surface2);border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--accent-glow)}\n  button:active{transform:scale(.97)}\n  button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#000;border-color:var(--accent)}\n  button.primary:hover{background:#d97706}\n\n  .message{\n    min-height:28px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:center;\n    padding:6px 16px;border-radius:8px;transition:all .2s;\n  }\n  .message.success{color:var(--success);background:rgba(52,211,153,.1)}\n  .message.error{color:var(--error);background:rgba(248,113,113,.1)}\n  .message.info{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(245,158,11,.1)}\n\n  .counter{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-dim)}\n  .counter span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n  .counter .f{color:var(--fire)}\n  .counter .i{color:var(--ice)}\n\n  @media(max-width:520px){\n    :root{--cell-size:min(14vw,64px)}\n    h1{font-size:1.4rem}\n    .rules-bar{font-size:.7rem;gap:8px}\n    .rules-bar div{padding:4px 8px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>\ud83d\udd25 <span>Tango</span> \ud83e\uddca</h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">Fill the 6\u00d76 grid with Fire and Ice. Each row and column must have exactly three of each \u2014 no three in a row!</p>\n\n<div class=\"rules-bar\">\n  <div><span class=\"sym\">\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</span> <span>\ud83e\uddca\ud83e\uddca\ud83e\uddca</span> per row &amp; column</div>\n  <div><span class=\"sym\">\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</span> no three same adjacent</div>\n  <div><span class=\"sym\">=</span> same &nbsp; <span class=\"sym\">\u00d7</span> different</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"counter\">\n  <span class=\"f\">\ud83d\udd25 <b id=\"fireCount\">0</b></span>\n  <span class=\"i\">\ud83e\uddca <b id=\"iceCount\">0</b></span>\n  <span>Empty <b id=\"emptyCount\">36</b></span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"board-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"board\" id=\"board\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"controls\">\n  <button class=\"primary\" onclick=\"checkSolution()\">\u2713 Check Solution</button>\n  <button onclick=\"newGame()\">\u27f3 New Game</button>\n  <button onclick=\"showSolution()\">\ud83d\udc41 Reveal</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"message\" id=\"message\"></div>\n\n<script>\nconst EMPTY=0,FIRE=1,ICE=2;\nconst SYMBOLS={0:'',1:'\ud83d\udd25',2:'\ud83e\uddca'};\nconst CLASSES={0:'',1:'fire',2:'ice'};\nlet solution=[], playerBoard=[], constraints=[], fixedCells=[];\n\nfunction shuffle(a){for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]]}return a}\n\nfunction isValidPlacement(grid,row,col,val){\n  if(col>=2&&grid[row][col-1]===val&&grid[row][col-2]===val)return false;\n  if(row>=2&&grid[row-1][col]===val&&grid[row-2][col]===val)return false;\n  let fc=0,ic=0;\n  for(let c=0;c<6;c++){if(grid[row][c]===FIRE)fc++;else if(grid[row][c]===ICE)ic++}\n  if(val===FIRE&&fc>=3)return false;if(val===ICE&&ic>=3)return false;\n  fc=0;ic=0;\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++){if(grid[r][col]===FIRE)fc++;else if(grid[r][col]===ICE)ic++}\n  if(val===FIRE&&fc>=3)return false;if(val===ICE&&ic>=3)return false;\n  return true;\n}\n\nfunction solve(grid,row,col){\n  if(row===6)return true;\n  const nr=col===5?row+1:row,nc=col===5?0:col+1;\n  const vals=[FIRE,ICE];shuffle(vals);\n  for(const v of vals){\n    if(isValidPlacement(grid,row,col,v)){\n      grid[row][col]=v;\n      if(solve(grid,nr,nc))return true;\n      grid[row][col]=EMPTY;\n    }\n  }\n  return false;\n}\n\nfunction generateSolution(){\n  const g=Array.from({length:6},()=>Array(6).fill(EMPTY));\n  solve(g,0,0);\n  return g;\n}\n\nfunction generateConstraints(sol){\n  const pairs=[];\n  const hPairs=[];\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++)for(let c=0;c<5;c++)hPairs.push({r1:r,c1:c,r2:r,c2:c+1});\n  const vPairs=[];\n  for(let r=0;r<5;r++)for(let c=0;c<6;c++)vPairs.push({r1:r,c1:c,r2:r+1,c2:c});\n  const allPairs=[...hPairs.map(p=>({...p,h:true})),...vPairs.map(p=>({...p,h:false}))];\n  shuffle(allPairs);\n  const constraints=[];\n  let count=0;\n  const target=6+Math.floor(Math.random()*3);\n  for(const p of allPairs){\n    if(count>=target)break;\n    if(sol[p.r1][p.c1]===sol[p.r2][p.c2]){\n      constraints.push({r1:p.r1,c1:p.c1,r2:p.r2,c2:p.c2,type:'same'});\n    }else{\n      constraints.push({r1:p.r1,c1:p.c1,r2:p.r2,c2:p.c2,type:'diff'});\n    }\n    count++;\n  }\n  return constraints;\n}\n\nfunction createPuzzle(sol,constraints){\n  const pb=Array.from({length:6},()=>Array(6).fill(EMPTY));\n  const fixed=[];\n  const cells=[];\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++)for(let c=0;c<6;c++)cells.push([r,c]);\n  shuffle(cells);\n  const keep=Math.floor(36*0.3);\n  for(let i=0;i<keep;i++){\n    const[r,c]=cells[i];\n    pb[r][c]=sol[r][c];\n    fixed.push(`${r},${c}`);\n  }\n  return{pb,fixed:new Set(fixed)};\n}\n\nfunction getCellPos(r,c){\n  return{gr:r*2,gc:c*2};\n}\n\nfunction getConstraintPos(r,c,h){\n  if(h){return{gr:r,gc:(c<5?c*2+1:-1)}}\n  else{return{gr:r*2+1,gc:c}}\n}\n\nfunction renderBoard(){\n  const board=document.getElementById('board');\n  board.innerHTML='';\n  const cellSize=parseInt(getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--cell-size'));\n\n  for(let gr=0;gr<12;gr++){\n    for(let gc=0;gc<12;gc++){\n      const el=document.createElement('div');\n      el.className='spacer';\n      el.style.gridRow=gr+1;el.style.gridColumn=gc+1;\n\n      const r=Math.floor(gr/2),c=Math.floor(gc/2);\n      const isCell=(gr%2===0&&gc%2===0);\n      const isHCons=(gr%2===0&&gc%2===1&&c<5);\n      const isVCons=(gr%2===1&&gc%2===0&&r<5);\n\n      if(isCell){\n        el.className='cell';\n        const val=playerBoard[r][c];\n        if(val!==EMPTY){el.classList.add(CLASSES[val]);el.textContent=SYMBOLS[val]}\n        if(fixedCells.has(`${r},${c}`))el.classList.add('fixed');\n        el.dataset.r=r;el.dataset.c=c;\n        el.addEventListener('click',()=>cycleCell(r,c));\n        board.appendChild(el);\n      }else if(isHCons){\n        const cons=constraints.find(x=>x.r1===r&&x.c1===c&&x.h);\n        el.className='constraint h';\n        if(cons){el.textContent=cons.type==='same'?'=':'\u00d7'}\n        else{el.className='constraint empty';el.textContent=''}\n        board.appendChild(el);\n      }else if(isVCons){\n        const cons=constraints.find(x=>x.r1===r&&x.c1===c&&!x.h);\n        el.className='constraint v';\n        if(cons){el.textContent=cons.type==='same'?'=':'\u00d7'}\n        else{el.className='constraint empty';el.textContent=''}\n        board.appendChild(el);\n      }else{\n        el.className='spacer';\n        board.appendChild(el);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  updateCounts();\n}\n\nfunction cycleCell(r,c){\n  if(fixedCells.has(`${r},${c}`))return;\n  playerBoard[r][c]=(playerBoard[r][c]+1)%3;\n  const el=document.querySelector(`.cell[data-r=\"${r}\"][data-c=\"${c}\"]`);\n  if(el){\n    el.className='cell';\n    const val=playerBoard[r][c];\n    if(val!==EMPTY){el.classList.add(CLASSES[val]);el.textContent=SYMBOLS[val]}\n    else{el.textContent=''}\n  }\n  clearMessage();\n  updateCounts();\n}\n\nfunction updateCounts(){\n  let f=0,ic=0,e=0;\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++)for(let c=0;c<6;c++){\n    if(playerBoard[r][c]===FIRE)f++;\n    else if(playerBoard[r][c]===ICE)ic++;\n    else e++;\n  }\n  document.getElementById('fireCount').textContent=f;\n  document.getElementById('iceCount').textContent=ic;\n  document.getElementById('emptyCount').textContent=e;\n}\n\nfunction checkSolution(){\n  clearMessage();\n  let errors=[];\n  let allFilled=true;\n\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++){\n    let fc=0,ic=0;\n    for(let c=0;c<6;c++){\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]===EMPTY){allFilled=false;continue}\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]===FIRE)fc++;else ic++;\n    }\n    if(fc!==3)for(let c=0;c<6;c++)if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY)errors.push({r,c,msg:'Row '+r+' has '+fc+' fire'});\n    if(ic!==3)for(let c=0;c<6;c++)if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY)errors.push({r,c,msg:'Row '+r+' has '+ic+' ice'});\n  }\n\n  for(let c=0;c<6;c++){\n    let fc=0,ic=0;\n    for(let r=0;r<6;r++){\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]===EMPTY){allFilled=false;continue}\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]===FIRE)fc++;else ic++;\n    }\n    if(fc!==3)for(let r=0;r<6;r++)if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY)errors.push({r,c,msg:'Col '+c+' has '+fc+' fire'});\n    if(ic!==3)for(let r=0;r<6;r++)if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY)errors.push({r,c,msg:'Col '+c+' has '+ic+' ice'});\n  }\n\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++){\n    for(let c=0;c<5;c++){\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY&&playerBoard[r][c+1]!==EMPTY){\n        if(playerBoard[r][c]===playerBoard[r][c+1]&&playerBoard[r][c+1]===playerBoard[r][c+2]){\n          errors.push({r:c+1?c:c,c:c+2,msg:'Three same in row'});\n          errors.push({r:r,c:c,msg:'Three same in row'});\n          errors.push({r:r,c:c+1,msg:'Three same in row'});\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  for(let c=0;c<6;c++){\n    for(let r=0;r<5;r++){\n      if(playerBoard[r][c]!==EMPTY&&playerBoard[r+1][c]!==EMPTY){\n        if(playerBoard[r][c]===playerBoard[r+1][c]&&playerBoard[r+1][c]===playerBoard[r+2][c]){\n          errors.push({r:r,c:c,msg:'Three same in col'});\n          errors.push({r:r+1,c:c,msg:'Three same in col'});\n          errors.push({r:r+2,c:c,msg:'Three same in col'});\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  for(const con of constraints){\n    const v1=playerBoard[con.r1][con.c1],v2=playerBoard[con.r2][con.c2];\n    if(v1!==EMPTY&&v2!==EMPTY){\n      if(con.type==='same'&&v1!==v2)errors.push({r:con.r1,c:con.c1,msg:'Constraint mismatch'});\n      if(con.type==='diff'&&v1===v2)errors.push({r:con.r1,c:con.c1,msg:'Constraint mismatch'});\n    }\n  }\n\n  const errorSet=new Set(errors.map(e=>`${e.r},${e.c}`));\n  const uniqueErrors=new Map();\n  for(const e of errors){\n    const key=`${e.r},${e.c}`;\n    if(!uniqueErrors.has(key))uniqueErrors.set(key,e.msg);\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(el=>{\n    el.classList.remove('error','correct-flash');\n    const key=`${el.dataset.r},${el.dataset.c}`;\n    if(errorSet.has(key))el.classList.add('error');\n  });\n\n  if(errors.length===0&&allFilled){\n    showMessage('\ud83c\udf89 Perfect! All rules satisfied!','success');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(el=>el.classList.add('correct-flash'));\n  }else if(!allFilled){\n    showMessage('\u26a0\ufe0f Fill all cells before checking.','info');\n  }else{\n    showMessage('\u2717 '+errors.length+' error'+(errors.length>1?'s':'')+' found. Red cells have issues.','error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showSolution(){\n  for(let r=0;r<6;r++)for(let c=0;c<6;c++){\n    playerBoard[r][c]=solution[r][c];\n  }\n  renderBoard();\n  showMessage('Solution revealed.','info');\n}\n\nfunction showMessage(text,type){\n  const el=document.getElementById('message');\n  el.textContent=text;el.className='message '+type;\n}\n\nfunction clearMessage(){\n  const el=document.getElementById('message');\n  el.textContent='';el.className='message';\n}\n\nfunction newGame(){\n  solution=generateSolution();\n  constraints=generateConstraints(solution);\n  const puzzle=createPuzzle(solution,constraints);\n  playerBoard=puzzle.pb;\n  fixedCells=puzzle.fixed;\n  renderBoard();\n  clearMessage();\n}\n\nnewGame();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
